SUMMARY:One Year Later: Legal Victory Ride and Rally - by Cycle Toronto
LOCATION:Ramsden Park
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.cycleto.ca/oneyearlater\n\nHosted by
  Cycle Toronto (https://www.cycleto.ca)\n\nLast year\, the Ontario
  Superior Court ruled that the province's attempt to remove 19 km of
  protected bike lanes was reckless and violated Canadians' Charter rights
  under Section 7. Join CycleTO to celebrate this victory and stand up
  against this ongoing pattern of provincial interference and undermining
  of local democracy.
END:VEVENT
