LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://meet.google.com/oat-zmif-odb\n\nHosted by
  Tech Worker's Coalition Canada
  (https://techworkerscoalition.org/canada/)\n\nDrop by for a virtual
  coffee hour on Sunday mornings to chat with fellow tech workers about
  what’s on your mind and to learn more about the Tech Worker’s
  Coalition. Whether you are a gig worker\, data labeler\, designer\,
  software engineer\, or content moderator\, labour solidarity for all!
